    <string name="tagline">one app instead of a home screen</string>
    <string name="welcome_body">Gretel turns your home screen into one app you choose. Once it is set as your home app, Home returns you to that app instead of an app grid.\n\nGretel does not lock your device. Its settings, Android settings, and your previous launcher stay within reach.</string>
