    <string name="hatch_lesson_title">Getting back</string>
    <string name="hatch_lesson_body">Home once returns you to your chosen app.\n\nHome twice quickly opens Gretel instead. If the second press keeps missing, choose a more relaxed double-Home timing in settings.\n\nIf you are ever stuck, Gretel is also listed under Apps in Android settings, and you can choose another home app there at any time.</string>
